{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061136/block/singleImage/3253217/wm/01M5Y0X6F39H1W6AMZVK9C83EE.jpg?updatedAt=1793326046\"/><figcaption>天文台今日(30日)表示， 高空反氣旋正為廣東帶來普遍晴朗的天氣。(資料圖片/蘇文傑攝)</figcaption></figure><p>天文台今日(30日)表示， 高空反氣旋正為廣東帶來普遍晴朗的天氣。 本港地區今日天晴。日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30度，最低25度。吹輕微至和緩偏東風。展望明日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。隨後一兩日部分時間有陽光。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061136/block/singleImage/3253219/df/01M658Y73M819NXGFZHGF941YR.png?updatedAt=1793326046\"/><figcaption>天文台今日(30日)表示， 高空反氣旋正為廣東帶來普遍晴朗的天氣。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:45:56.397039+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:07:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.983057+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:38:23.487280+00:00","content_hash":"577bb6cf63f841a17a7b45f9e6d4ba816c44161995f522d8a464774990d3bad9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:45:56.397039+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}